 r←Test_AskNumber_007(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;msg;was;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "OnHelp" callback with all possible ways to define it.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 #.TEMP←⎕NS''
 ⎕THIS.wasCalled←0
 #.TEMP.MyCallback←{
     n←⍵
     ⎕THIS.wasCalled←1
     ⍬
 }
 #.TEMP.parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber
 #.TEMP.parms.default←3
 #.TEMP.parms.hasHelpBtn←1
 #.TEMP.parms.onHelp←'#.TEMP.MyCallback'

 n←#.TEMP.parms(#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber ∆Ask)'Number of copies:'
 ⎕DL 0.1
 ⎕NQ n.HelpBtn'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.GoToTidyUp #.TEMP.wasCalled=0
 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
